@ifnottex
@node Top
@top CMacs

CMacs extends Emacs with a deep GLib/GObject integration layer,
bringing GObject Introspection, a GLib-aware event loop, the Bacon
shell, Crispy C scripting, and a D-Bus service for cross-process
interaction.
@end ifnottex

@menu
* Overview::                    What CMacs adds to Emacs.
* GLib Event Loop::             How GMainContext integrates with pselect().
* GObject Bridge::              Wrapping GObjects in elisp.
